</li>
<li>
<p>Now you can call <code>gcc</code> to build software for Windows.</p>
<div class=3D"highlight"><pre id=3D"__code_2"><span></span><nav class=3D"md=
-code__nav"><button class=3D"md-code__button" title=3D"Copy to clipboard" d=
