></nav><code><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>gcc<span class=3D"w"> </span>--ver=
sion
<span class=3D"go">gcc.exe (Rev3, Built by MSYS2 project) 16.2.0</span>
</code></pre></div>
</li>
<li>
<p>After installing MSYS2 it will update itself via <code>pacman</code>, se=
e the <a href=3D"https://www.msys2.org/docs/updating/">update guide</a> for=
 more information.</p>
</li>
</ol>
